/* The first 30 seconds of a session used to be an empty surface: the connect
   handshake alone exceeds 10 s for 16% of sessions (p90 33 s), and the model's
   interpreter lag puts the first spoken word seconds after that. 40% of all
   sessions were abandoned inside 30 s and 71% of those were followed by another
   attempt within 14 s — people were not bored, they had nothing telling them
   anything was happening. These three lines fill exactly that window. */
